cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "language_models: an LLM / RAG toolkit built on the BaseModel interface (TextGenerator + TensorRT-LLM)"
abstract: >-
  Large-Language-Model (LLM) toolkit built on the `BaseModel` interface, providing a
  keras `TextGenerator`, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), function calling,
  multimodal (text + image) support and TensorRT-LLM accelerated inference — part of
  the yui-mhcp projects.
